{"h":2857,"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.20069203694661458,"c":1,"h":0.017606635791092451,"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.086505191492090627,"y":0.060881735739505283},{"c":1,"w":0.30676691691080726,"x":0.084548340183866907,"t":"TEST 2, WRITING TASK 2","y":0.10627296238864437,"h":0.025824995955192942},{"y":0.14680232529729076,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7 score.","h":0.01744186102384615,"x":0.086505185073955229,"w":0.58304499308268232,"c":1},{"t":"People have differing views about the significance of the theatres and cinemas in the","x":0.086447712380945341,"y":0.17405393969036309,"w":0.69388320922851565,"h":0.02032103915578265,"c":1},{"w":0.69219345092773443,"x":0.086423848959015476,"t":"present age of technology. While some argue that there are no need for theatres and","y":0.19572098404401939,"c":1,"h":0.020540625169779392},{"y":0.21620758533868278,"t":"cinemas when it is possible to have access to online version of everything, in my opinion,","h":0.020733659128945869,"x":0.086458104419175466,"w":0.71811004638671871,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"that facilities are still of paramount importance for both people and economics.","x":0.086454143445063594,"y":0.2382945482951826,"h":0.020158937880006889,"w":0.65578964233398429},{"w":0.66089965820312502,"c":1,"x":0.086505188988199394,"y":0.26731980417067758,"t":"On the one hand, people today are able to watch any content they want through","h":0.019017405072820126},{"w":0.41695500691731768,"h":0.019013336774266754,"t":"Internet without spending a lot of time and money","y":0.28924418605745073,"x":0.084775091835090702,"c":1},{"h":0.018984856682277451,"y":0.31831395351567848,"t":"Firstly, using electronic devise and social platforms makes it possible for users to watch","w":0.71799306233723958,"c":1,"x":0.08650519890133665},{"x":0.086448435279843069,"h":0.020568222996235952,"y":0.33849212965411113,"w":0.6956147766113282,"c":1,"t":"any movies or films at any time they want. Shows and films are put at a certain time"},{"y":0.3596021632799894,"x":0.084733632924059249,"w":0.70596318562825522,"h":0.019985360478587455,"c":1,"t":"in cinemas, theatres which is not suitable for everyone. But if people use internet they"},{"c":1,"w":0.6885813395182292,"x":0.086505177924796048,"t":"can ensure the flexibility. Secondly, prices that have to be paid to enter cinemas and","y":0.3822674415784002,"h":0.017441861023846261},{"y":0.4040697674698136,"t":"theatres are not affordable for many people However, through using the Internet, to","w":0.6885813395182292,"c":1,"h":0.018953325366373286,"x":0.086505177927860943},{"h":0.018256778063016621,"y":0.42373433879270239,"w":0.35828152974446614,"x":0.086441059200955503,"c":1,"t":"watch a movie or film can be much cheaper"},{"y":0.45223949947704445,"x":0.086444333320297009,"h":0.020867110800292688,"c":1,"t":"On the other hand, I, however argue that theatres and cinemas still have their","w":0.64374323527018229},{"c":1,"t":"significant part in terms of environment and financial benefits. For example, cinemas","h":0.020576266161289269,"x":0.086455341794958451,"y":0.47368557860664962,"w":0.70079152425130209},{"c":1,"y":0.49488180002249749,"x":0.086439948044578524,"w":0.69217890421549477,"t":"are provided with very big screens which can make people feel themselves inside the","h":0.020317620877371989},{"w":0.709342549641927,"h":0.019001131211234812,"c":1,"t":"movie and in theatres watchers would enjoy the shows and and performances done by","x":0.086505200741320135,"y":0.51598837188787194},{"x":0.086440421225499331,"y":0.53681163738828619,"t":"real actors, which is impossible to do in computers and mobile phone screens. On top of","w":0.71813385009765629,"h":0.021656193876700258,"c":1},{"h":0.020531039708473142,"y":0.55807186788902197,"c":1,"x":0.086451951069366539,"t":"this, public theatres can bring the money that can be spent on public needs New roads","w":0.70945546468098963},{"y":0.57923211524917795,"w":0.68869618733723958,"t":"and other facilities can be erected for public use with the financial funds taken from","h":0.020647241153276541,"c":1,"x":0.086445137378698203},{"x":0.086505191843412627,"h":0.017516111476676643,"w":0.20242214202880862,"t":"those cinemas, theatres.","y":0.60319767412791381,"c":1},{"x":0.08642361003576568,"w":0.67490636189778641,"h":0.022349902180377357,"c":1,"y":0.62930735641512614,"t":"In conclusion, theatres and cinemas can be refered as non-useful places due to the"},{"w":0.70761245727539068,"y":0.6511546534522773,"h":0.018903486039606787,"c":1,"x":0.086505190278471297,"t":"development s in modern technologies but I believe that the use of them would bring a"},{"y":0.67284814581679009,"x":0.086505199862146429,"t":"lot of advantages to bot people and society","w":0.35294115702311202,"h":0.019012319032256642,"c":1},{"y":0.7106368086397119,"x":0.08823528918902071,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","h":0.01469559132260323,"w":0.27162630716959635,"c":1},{"w":0.59183731079101565,"t":"This is a strong response, with a series of ideas for each part, presented","x":0.12796057848049069,"h":0.021497978039602073,"c":1,"y":0.73063710680577221},{"x":0.12802768579963242,"c":1,"y":0.75000000002858036,"t":"effectively. It starts with a note that different countries have different patterns and","w":0.67820068359374996,"h":0.019069279216235135},{"y":0.7673198040095115,"c":1,"t":"the writer's position is clear in the first paragraph [facilities are still of paramount","x":0.12629759748704109,"w":0.66608993530273441,"h":0.019017405072820237},{"w":0.650519053141276,"c":1,"t":"importance]. The first half captures the benefits of watching performances and","y":0.78621413595850276,"x":0.12629756676823034,"h":0.019018422147458636},{"h":0.017565951470814856,"t":"movies online; it saves time and money, people can watch at any time of day,","x":0.12802769289325389,"w":0.64186848958333331,"c":1,"y":0.80510846740898823},{"t":"with flexibility. Paragraph 4 presents the economic and cultural benefits, the big","x":0.12797737863846143,"y":0.82260648202755704,"h":0.021882961478743912,"w":0.66099502563476564,"c":1},{"h":0.018967565746053738,"c":1,"w":0.66089965820312502,"t":"screen makes people feel more included in the experience, real live actors, who","x":0.12629757571297981,"y":0.84149755049770059},{"h":0.021740847321304102,"w":0.6714523824055989,"t":"can so dome things that computers cannot, public money can be raised from get","x":0.12794724839173852,"c":1,"y":0.8592106416795473},{"t":"togethers for specific needs. The candidate concludes that some people think that","x":0.12625508794988416,"h":0.019099645968331136,"c":1,"y":0.87778438109778489,"w":0.68694142659505208},{"c":1,"t":"cinemas and theatres are [non-useful places] but they believe there could bring a","h":0.018916708677277128,"y":0.89678096570766985,"w":0.66782007853190106,"x":0.12802767690644637},{"y":0.91486866693248292,"w":0.15462888081868487,"c":1,"t":"lot of advantages.","h":0.01892257754497384,"x":0.125992569129522},{"w":0.031141869227091473,"x":0.089965397474791334,"y":0.96075581403917587,"t":"130","h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1}]}